Did you ever do anything like this since we've been...?

362
00:16:29,590 --> 00:16:30,420
从来没有
Nope, never.

363
00:16:30,420 --> 00:16:32,630
那太不巧了
Oh, that's too bad.

364
00:16:34,130 --> 00:16:35,590
我能问你个问题吗
You know, can I ask you a question?

365
00:16:36,380 --> 00:16:38,300
为什么现在告诉我
Why are you telling me this now?

366
00:16:38,300 --> 00:16:41,400
正如之前所说  我们要结婚了
Well, like I said, we're about to get married,

367
00:16:41,400 --> 00:16:44,090
