and I-I want a clean slate.

368
00:16:44,090 --> 00:16:45,290
不藏秘密
No secrets.

369
00:16:45,290 --> 00:16:46,840
真的吗  可我怎么觉得是
Really? Be-Because to me,

370
00:16:46,840 --> 00:16:47,960
我们要结婚了
it seems like we're about to get married

371
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:49,650
而你想搞破坏呢
and you're trying to sabotage it.

372
00:16:49,650 --> 00:16:51,470
那你比较希望我不告诉你吗
W-Would you rather I didn't tell you?

373
00:16:51,470 --> 00:16:53,280
不是  我不希望我们之间藏秘密
No, I don't want there to be secrets between us.

374
00:16:53,280 --> 00:16:54,470
这样我就不懂了
See, now I'm confused.

375
00:16:54,470 --> 00:16:55,980
那我该怎么办
