376
00:16:55,980 --> 00:16:58,640
让你的嘴别碰其他女人
Uh, keep your mouth off other women.

377
00:16:59,860 --> 00:17:01,160
我能做到
I can do that.

378
00:17:01,160 --> 00:17:01,580
从今开始
Uh, uh, f-from now on,

379
00:17:01,580 --> 00:17:05,370
这张嘴  除了你与食物啥都不碰
this mouth-- you and food, that's it.

380
00:17:08,750 --> 00:17:10,200
行吧
Okay.

381
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:13,060
真的吗
Yeah?

382
00:17:13,980 --> 00:17:16,320
发生这种事我肯定不高兴
Look, I'm not happy this happened,

383
00:17:16,320 --> 00:17:18,770
但我觉得我可以放下
but I think I can get past it.

384
00:17:18,770 --> 00:17:20,570
毕竟那时候我们也没订婚
I mean, we weren't engaged at the time,

385
00:17:20,570 --> 00:17:22,450
而且只是接吻而已
and it was just kissing.

386
00:17:22,450 --> 00:17:23,900
对啊
Right.

387
00:17:23,900 --> 00:17:25,580
接吻也不爽
Just kissing.

388
00:17:25,580 --> 00:17:27,420
感觉一点都不好
It wasn't even very good.

389
00:17:27,420 --> 00:17:29,440
她满嘴烟味  我一直晕船呕吐...
She was a smoker. I'd just been seasick...

390
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:31,900
够了  别说了
Okay, that's enough. Stop talking.

391
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:36,880
那...
So...

392
00:17:38,230 --> 00:17:40,030
我们还是会结婚的吧
we're still getting married?

393
00:17:41,670 --> 00:17:43,450
对
Yes.

394
00:17:44,580 --> 00:17:46,760
因为我们彼此相爱
Because we love each other.

395
00:17:46,760 --> 00:17:48,120
对
Yes.

396
00:17:48,400 --> 00:17:50,930
这是我们这辈子最开心的一天
And it's the happiest day of our lives.

397
00:17:51,300 --> 00:17:53,050
别得寸进尺
Don't push it.

398
00:18:02,200 --> 00:18:03,330
你好
Hello.

399
00:18:03,330 --> 00:18:04,360
你好
Hello.

400
00:18:04,360 --> 00:18:08,970
听着  我一直在思考情侣关系
Listen, I've been thinking a lot about relationships

401
00:18:08,970 --> 00:18:11,650
以及中间的种种复杂  我想...
and how difficult they can be, and I think...

402
00:18:11,650 --> 00:18:14,560
我也想了很多  谢尔顿
I've been thinking about them, too, Sheldon.

403
00:18:15,190 --> 00:18:18,780
当你女友对我来说是一项挑战
Being your girlfriend is so challenging.

404
00:18:18,780 --> 00:18:20,410
无论在情绪上
Emotionally,

405
00:18:20,410 --> 00:18:21,770
还是肉体上
physically.

406
00:18:21,770 --> 00:18:26,300
这几年我一直保持着极度的耐心
I've been incredibly patient for years.

407
00:18:26,300 --> 00:18:27,990
强烈反对
Strongly disagree.

408
00:18:27,990 --> 00:18:29,870
但请继续
Go on.

409
00:18:30,390 --> 00:18:32,920
好的
Okay, well...

410
00:18:33,690 --> 00:18:37,380
这话很难说出口  因为我爱你
this isn't easy to say, because I love you,

411
00:18:37,380 --> 00:18:38,820
可是...
but...

412
00:18:39,930 --> 00:18:43,020
我需要些时间缓一缓  后退一步
I need some time to take a step back

413
00:18:43,020 --> 00:18:46,360
重新评估下我们的状况
and reevaluate our situation.

414
00:18:49,820 --> 00:18:53,140
希望你能理解
I hope you understand.

415
00:18:55,080 --> 00:18:57,640
好的
Okay.

416
00:18:58,030 --> 00:19:01,070
再见  谢尔顿
Bye, Sheldon.

417
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:20,100
咕噜[魔戒角色]
Well, Gollum...

418
00:19:22,110 --> 00:19:24,240
你是戒指专家
...you're an expert on rings.

419
00:19:25,680 --> 00:19:28,830
你说我该拿这枚戒指怎么办呢
